===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|hele|id=heel}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hēla}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*hą̄hilō}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*hanhilaz}}, diminutive of {{der|en|gem-pro|*hanhaz||heel, hock}}, equivalent to {{suf|en|hock|le|nocat=1}}. More at {{m|en|hock}}.

Compare {{cog|frr|haiel}}, {{cog|fy|hyl}}, {{cog|nl|hiel}}, {{cog|nds-de|Hiel}}, {{cog|da|-}} and {{cog|no|hæl}}, {{cog|sv|häl}}.

