=====Usage notes=====
Although it is an adverb, {{m|nl||heel}} may be inflected to {{m|nl|hele}} so as to match a following adjective. For example, both of these sentences are correct:
* {{ux|nl|Dat is een '''heel''' grote boom.|-}}
* {{ux|nl|Dat is een '''hele''' grote boom.|That is a '''very''' large tree.}}

The second sentence with {{m|nl||hele}} may, however, be regarded as informal and less appropriate for formal writing.

Only {{m|nl||heel}} is obviously possible when the adjective is not inflected to begin with:
* {{ux|nl|Dat is een '''heel''' groot huis.|That is a '''very''' large house.}}

